			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Reformat shell environment utility comments\n\nReflow the documentation comments in `EnhanceShellEnvironment.rs` to adhere to the 72-column hard limit. This change addresses line-wrapping issues in the explanation of PATH injection logic, specifically regarding Homebrew binary discovery and language server initialization.\n\nThe content and logic remain unchanged; this is a purely cosmetic adjustment to ensure the codebase maintains consistent formatting standards for Rust documentation blocks.",
			"SHA": "6c6cb93cc701e9ec9f730429bd7ee87a862bbe5e"
		},
